# Root gitignore: repo-wide build/test output. web/ has its own
# web/.gitignore for the console toolchain.

# goreleaser output, anchored to the repo root: an unanchored `dist/`
# would also match internal/rest/static/dist (the committed console
# embed) and silently ignore newly generated bundle files.
/dist/

# Go build/test byproducts
*.test
*.out
coverage.*

# Editor and OS noise
.DS_Store
